SUMMARY:Hoosiers: The Best Shot - Director's Cut w/ filmmaker | Additiona
 l Films and Guests
DESCRIPTION:The quintessential basketball movie—and perhaps the quintes
 sential Indiana movie—returns to the big screen with a new 4K director'
 s cut. When a coach with a checkered past (a career-best Gene Hackman) an
 d a local drunk (the one and only Dennis Hopper) come together to train a
  high school basketball team\, this small-town Indiana squad skyrockets t
 o become a top contender for the state championship. [114 min\; sports\, 
 drama\; English]A Q&amp\;A with director David Anspaugh and writer Angelo
  Pizzo will follow the screening.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The quintessential basketball movie—a
 nd perhaps the quintessential Indiana movie—returns to the big screen w
 ith a new 4K director's cut. When a coach with a checkered past (a career
 -best Gene Hackman) and a local drunk (the one and only Dennis Hopper) co
 me together to train a high school basketball team\, this small-town Indi
 ana squad skyrockets to become a top contender for the state championship
 . [114 min\; sports\, drama\; English]</p><p><i><strong>A Q&amp\;A with d
 irector David Anspaugh and writer Angelo Pizzo will follow the screening.
